{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-6-19","kind":"proposition","title":"相似三角形面积比等于对应边比的平方","englishTitle":"Similar triangles are to one another in the duplicate ratio of the corresponding sides.","book":6,"number":19,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:6.prop.19","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:6.prop.19/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":19,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/zh-hans/幾何原本/卷六"}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-6-19@raw-7cd1004bfd92f154","contentId":"euclid-6-19","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"7cd1004bfd92f15456d37e2533c28c1c6acdf175ef788ba6cb3e91d46467ec66","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-6-19.statement","euclid-6-19.construction.1","euclid-6-19.construction.2","euclid-6-19.proof.1","euclid-6-19.proof.2","euclid-6-19.proof.3","euclid-6-19.proof.4","euclid-6-19.proof.5","euclid-6-19.proof.6","euclid-6-19.proof.7","euclid-6-19.proof.8","euclid-6-19.conclusion","euclid-6-19.historical.1","euclid-6-19.historical.2","euclid-6-19.historical.3","euclid-6-19.historical.4","euclid-6-19.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-6-19.statement","contentId":"euclid-6-19","revisionId":"euclid-6-19@raw-7cd1004bfd92f154","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"fe5304afaebb544230ef8fe06ae4cae35441ac7810109083e50496f34ddcc7bb","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Similar triangles are to one another in the duplicate ratio of the corresponding sides."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"平方比个对应方的三角形相类似。"},{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"相似三角形之比例为其相似边再加之比例"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"相似三角形的比例是其相似边的和。"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-19.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-6-19","revisionId":"euclid-6-19@raw-7cd1004bfd92f154","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"c5d2b104450ec255582f705bea0386824279b6ff19dcb09bf239e748788c6064","citations":["euclid-5-def-11"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let ABC, DEF be similar triangles having the angle at B equal to the angle at E, and such that, as AB is to BC, so is DE to EF, so that BC corresponds to EF; [[V. Def. 11](/principles/euclid-5-def-11)] I say that the triangle ABC has to the triangle DEF a ratio duplicate of that which BC has to EF."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让ABC、DEF等三角形类似,角度为B,相当于角度为E,AB至BC的比例等于DE至EF,BC的比例相当于EF;我说三角形ABC与三角形DEF的比例是BC与EF的比例的重复；AB 与 BC 之比等于 DE 与 EF 之比。 [[V. Def. 11](/principles/euclid-5-def-11)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-19.construction.2","contentId":"euclid-6-19","revisionId":"euclid-6-19@raw-7cd1004bfd92f154","order":2,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"15398a2dd5706d7d4187b054f9661568f178db391fb1b802ee13c2a16eb8b119","citations":["euclid-6-11"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For let a third proportional BG be taken to BC, EF, so that, as BC is to EF, so is EF to BG; [[VI. 11](/principles/euclid-6-11)] and let AG be joined."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"将第三个成比例 BG改为BC EF,BC和EF, EF的比例等于EF和BG;将AG连接起来；BC 与 EF 之比等于 EF 与 BG 之比。 [[VI. 11](/principles/euclid-6-11)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-19.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-6-19","revisionId":"euclid-6-19@raw-7cd1004bfd92f154","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"0b7f069bb874c74445e0ada7cfe93188c3f2afef935b8dee0370927b1d942b89","citations":["euclid-5-16"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Since then, as AB is to BC, so is DE to EF, therefore, alternately, as AB is to DE, so is BC to EF. [[V. 16](/principles/euclid-5-16)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"从那时起,AB比BC等于DE比EF,因此,AB比DE等于EF；AB 与 BC 之比等于 DE 与 EF 之比；AB 与 DE 之比等于 BC 与 EF 之比。 [[V. 16](/principles/euclid-5-16)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-19.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-6-19","revisionId":"euclid-6-19@raw-7cd1004bfd92f154","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"8c4563f5468d892dd3928632a4741bb28dcf75acd28a3217102c9fdd8db09370","citations":["euclid-5-11"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But, as BC is to EF, so is EF to BG; therefore also, as AB is to DE, so is EF to BG. [[V. 11](/principles/euclid-5-11)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是,BC对EF的比等于EF对BG的比;因此,AB对DE的比等于EF对BG的比；BC 与 EF 之比等于 EF 与 BG 之比；AB 与 DE 之比等于 EF 与 BG 之比。 [[V. 11](/principles/euclid-5-11)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-19.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-6-19","revisionId":"euclid-6-19@raw-7cd1004bfd92f154","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"6ff09df80880c3741b74e83f7039eeaf73296f40ece3cf80860ad0928d7ddb68","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore in the triangles ABG, DEF the sides about the equal angles are reciprocally proportional."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,在三角形ABG,DEF中,对等角度的两边是成比例。"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-19.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-6-19","revisionId":"euclid-6-19@raw-7cd1004bfd92f154","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"8ab5c5e045967be0f6b39853ea0f5814fc9ab3c90f060cfa88e8164db2111529","citations":["euclid-6-15"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But those triangles which have one angle equal to one angle, and in which the sides about the equal angles are reciprocally proportional, are equal; [[VI. 15](/principles/euclid-6-15)] therefore the triangle ABG is equal to the triangle DEF."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是,具有一个角度等于一个角度,而对等角度的两边是成比例的三角形是相等的;因此,三角形ABG等于三角形DEF。 [[VI. 15](/principles/euclid-6-15)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-19.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-6-19","revisionId":"euclid-6-19@raw-7cd1004bfd92f154","order":7,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"9b6487412993219b2f404ad49bd57aaac9b8aa981447903053988bf17b2ea31c","citations":["euclid-5-def-9"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Now since, as BC is to EF, so is EF to BG, and, if three straight lines be proportional, the first has to the third a ratio duplicate of that which it has to the second, [[V. Def. 9](/principles/euclid-5-def-9)] therefore BC has to BG a ratio duplicate of that which CB has to EF."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"现在,BC比EF等于EF比BG,如果三条直线为成比例,则第一条与第三条的比重是它与第二条的比重的重复,因此,BC比BG比CB比EF；BC 与 EF 之比等于 EF 与 BG 之比。 [[V. Def. 9](/principles/euclid-5-def-9)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-19.proof.6","contentId":"euclid-6-19","revisionId":"euclid-6-19@raw-7cd1004bfd92f154","order":8,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 6","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"3f3ab57567cc4028e3ff9a872f527338261a9e191654205b89db2a0602e032e8","citations":["euclid-6-1"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But, as CB is to BG, so is the triangle ABC to the triangle ABG; [[VI. 1](/principles/euclid-6-1)] therefore the triangle ABC also has to the triangle ABG a ratio duplicate of that which BC has to EF."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是,CB比BG的比例等于ABC比ABG三角;因此,ABC比ABG的三角比例与BC比EF的三角比例相同；CB 与 BG 之比等于 ABC 与 ABG 之比。 [[VI. 1](/principles/euclid-6-1)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-19.proof.7","contentId":"euclid-6-19","revisionId":"euclid-6-19@raw-7cd1004bfd92f154","order":9,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 7","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"67175fd66a8b5712485bfb06ea3d551cf67c64dca0cc9fd3df4bd9a48723e453","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But the triangle ABG is equal to the triangle DEF; therefore the triangle ABC also has to the triangle DEF a ratio duplicate of that which BC has to EF."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但三角形ABG等于三角形DEF;因此三角形ABC也与三角形DEF的比是BC比EF的重复。"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-19.proof.8","contentId":"euclid-6-19","revisionId":"euclid-6-19@raw-7cd1004bfd92f154","order":10,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 8","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"6d0def46992eb0b105b82d6bce6477450c524a884c436026a0e1ed896becf6c9","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore etc."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"由此命题得证。"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-19.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-6-19","revisionId":"euclid-6-19@raw-7cd1004bfd92f154","order":11,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"152ff868b3e75b156650bd554faf9a8b078d28380b700dbed50d2f47f4eace38","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Porism. From this it is manifest that, if three straight lines be proportional, then, as the first is to the third, so is the figure described on the first to that which is similar and similarly described on the second. Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"普罗里斯姆,从这一点可以看出,如果三条直线为成比例,那么,第一条直线与第三条直线的比等于第一个直线与第二个直线直线相同和相似的数字之比。"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-19.historical.1","contentId":"euclid-6-19","revisionId":"euclid-6-19@raw-7cd1004bfd92f154","order":12,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"fb1176e9f115b6cfe96159b0196e4a772cd3bb0347a3033d892641f365d0eb70","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"相似三角形之比例为其相似边再加之比例"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"相似三角形的比例是其相似边的和。"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-19.historical.2","contentId":"euclid-6-19","revisionId":"euclid-6-19@raw-7cd1004bfd92f154","order":13,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"6975e878dc70b3a24fad6d3c8d92764bd8517f865fea81546258c6f67207b25b","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"解曰：如甲乙丙丁戊己两角形等角其乙与戊丙与己相当之角各等而甲乙与乙丙之比例若丁戊与戊己题言两形之比例为乙丙与戊己两边再加之比例"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"解释如下：例如，甲乙丙丁戊己 和两个三角形是等角；乙、戊丙 和 己 具有相等的角度，甲乙 与 乙丙 的比例是 丁戊 和 戊己 的命题。该命题解释了两个形状的比例是 乙丙 和 戊己，再加上两边的比例。"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-19.historical.3","contentId":"euclid-6-19","revisionId":"euclid-6-19@raw-7cd1004bfd92f154","order":14,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"231cdcd556ebaa9df5390dd7dfd797867d1c8fae0696693a0cc5d8c437fb5be4","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"先论曰：若两角形等即乙丙与戊己两边亦等而各两等边为相同之比例即两形亦相同之比例就令作再加之比例亦未免为相同之比例则相等之两形即可为两等边再加之比例矣"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"首先，证明如下：如果两个三角形相等，即 乙丙 和 戊己 也相等，每条边的比例相同，即两个形状也具有相同的比例，然后再次加上比例。未 免于具有相同比例，那么两个相等的形状可以是等边，然后再加比例。"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-19.historical.4","contentId":"euclid-6-19","revisionId":"euclid-6-19@raw-7cd1004bfd92f154","order":15,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"7ded9a4302a640f1ac89d5fa67dc433f6977b751f6d4d4ad763cb630d2b61ed1","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"后论曰：若乙丙边大于戊己边即于乙丙线上截取乙庚为连比例之第三率令乙丙与戊己之比例若戊己与乙庚也〈本篇十一〉次作甲庚直线其甲乙与乙丙之比例若丁戊与戊己更之即甲乙与丁戊若乙丙与戊己也而乙丙与戊己若戊己与乙庚则甲乙与丁戊若戊己与乙庚也夫甲乙庚与丁戊己两角形有乙戊两等角而各两旁之两边又互相视〈本篇十五〉即两形等则甲乙丙形与丁戊己形之比例若甲乙丙形与甲乙庚形矣〈五卷七〉又甲乙丙与甲乙庚两等高角形之比例若乙丙底与乙庚底〈本篇一〉则甲乙丙形与丁戊己形之比例亦若乙丙底与乙庚底也既乙丙戊己乙庚三线为连比例则一乙丙与三乙庚之比例为一乙丙与二戊己再加之比例矣是甲乙丙与丁戊己两形之比例为乙丙与戊己再加之比例也系依本题可显凡三直线为连比例即第一线上角形与第二线上角形之比例若第一线与第三线之比例如上甲乙丙三直线为连比例其甲与乙上各有角形相似而体势等则一甲线与三丙线之比例若甲形与乙形也何者甲线与丙线之比例为甲线与乙线再加之比例而甲形与乙形之比例亦甲线与乙线再加之比例则甲形与乙形之比例若甲线与丙线矣依显二乙上角形与三丙上角形相似而体势等则二乙形与三丙形之比例若一甲线与三丙线"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"后证明如下：若乙丙边大于戊己边即于乙丙线上截取乙庚为连比例之第三率令乙丙与戊己之比例若戊己与乙庚也〈本篇十一〉次作甲庚直线其甲乙与乙丙之比例若丁戊与戊己更之即甲乙与丁戊若乙丙与戊己也而乙丙与戊己若戊己与乙庚则甲乙与丁戊若戊己与乙庚也夫甲乙庚与丁戊己两三角形有乙戊两等角而各两旁之两边又互相视〈本篇十五〉即两形等则甲乙丙形与丁戊己形之比例若甲乙丙形与甲乙庚形矣〈五卷七〉又甲乙丙与甲乙庚两等高三角形之比例若乙丙底与乙庚底〈本篇一〉则甲乙丙形与丁戊己形之比例亦若乙丙底与乙庚底也既乙丙戊己乙庚三线为连比例则一乙丙与三乙庚之比例为一乙丙与二戊己再加之比例矣是甲乙丙与丁戊己两形之比例为乙丙与戊己再加之比例也系依本题可显凡三直线为连比例即第一线上三角形与第二线上三角形之比例若第一线与第三线之比例如上甲乙丙三直线为连比例其甲与乙上各有三角形相似而体势等则一甲线与三丙线之比例若甲形与乙形也何者甲线与丙线之比例为甲线与乙线再加之比例而甲形与乙形之比例亦甲线与乙线再加之比例则甲形与乙形之比例若甲线与丙线矣依显二乙上三角形与三丙上三角形相似而体势等则二乙形与三丙形之比例若一甲线与三丙线"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-19.source","contentId":"euclid-6-19","revisionId":"euclid-6-19@raw-7cd1004bfd92f154","order":16,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d10b5ca859e91c4a8544c1e95fccd37fe823cf9d07183c3b2ebf4fdb620eec1b","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:6.prop.19/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:6.prop.19\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)\nHistorical Chinese source: https://zh.wikisource.org/zh-hans/幾何原本/卷六"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-6-19:euclid-5-def-11:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-6-19","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-6-19.construction.1"],"targetContentId":"euclid-5-def-11","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:6.prop.19","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:6.prop.19/","sourceLabel":"V. Def. 11"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-6-19:euclid-6-11:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-6-19","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-6-19.construction.2"],"targetContentId":"euclid-6-11","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:6.prop.19","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:6.prop.19/","sourceLabel":"VI. 11"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-6-19:euclid-5-16:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-6-19","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-6-19.proof.1"],"targetContentId":"euclid-5-16","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference"